## How to read dual licenses

Several Tauri, Serde, and Tokio-adjacent crates are offered as
`Apache-2.0 OR MIT` or `MIT OR Apache-2.0`. Either license may be
followed. This project does not narrow that choice. A distributor who
needs a single election should pick one of the stated licenses and keep
the upstream copyright notices.

Rebuild this file when a direct dependency is added, removed, or bumped
to a version whose license metadata changed.
